Tupolev Tu-1: Ready for battle
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33592511/485f5b92058347f5283a52f5501612a4ccad69d9.png

Become the owner of the rare aircraft – the  Tupolev Tu-1! Survivability, four powerful autocannons, and a long-lasting boost make the Tu-1 an ideal hunter of both enemy bombers and attack aircraft!

In addition you will receive  a  personal battle mission on an experienced crew with free skill points!

Bundle is available for purchase till December 1 (03:20 PT / 06:20 ET).

